@startuml

title Network Server - Control, downlink y métricas

left to right direction

skinparam shadowing false

skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam titleFontSize 22
skinparam classFontSize 18
skinparam classAttributeFontSize 15
skinparam classMethodFontSize 15
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14

skinparam packageTitleFontSize 16
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam Padding 8

skinparam nodesep 20
skinparam ranksep 20


class NetworkServer {
    - adrEnabled : boolean

    + configureAdr(enabled : boolean)
    + getPerformanceMetricsStore() : PerformanceMetricsStore
}


package "Control de la transmisión" as PKG_CONTROL {

    class AdrManager {
        + recommendSpreadingFactor(...) : int
    }

    class DownlinkProcessor {
        + process(...)
    }

    class DeviceSession <<estado de sesión>> {
        - currentSf : int
        - recommendedSf : int
        - ackRequired : boolean

        + setRecommendedSf(sf : int)
        + isAckRequired() : boolean
    }
}


package "Registro de métricas" as PKG_METRICS {

    class PerformanceMetricsStore {
        + add(metric : PerformanceMetric)
        + getAll() : List
    }

    class PerformanceMetric
}


NetworkServer *-- AdrManager
NetworkServer *-- DownlinkProcessor
NetworkServer *-- PerformanceMetricsStore

AdrManager --> DeviceSession : actualiza recomendación
DownlinkProcessor --> DeviceSession : consulta estado

PerformanceMetricsStore --> PerformanceMetric : almacena


AdrManager -[hidden]right- DownlinkProcessor
DownlinkProcessor -[hidden]right- PerformanceMetricsStore


note bottom of NetworkServer
Coordina el control posterior
a la evaluación de la transmisión.
end note

@enduml